meta {
  name: Conversation Session
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  End-to-end conversation practice flow. Log in first (auth → users).

  Run in order:
  1. conversations/auxiliary/suggest-ai-interlocutor (optional)
  2. conversations/crud/create → sets conversationId
  3. conversations/ongoing/ai-initialize-sse (SSE)
  4. conversations/ongoing/user-save-message
  5. conversations/ongoing/ai-request-message-sse (SSE)
  6. conversations/ongoing/user-generate-analysis
  7. conversations/ongoing/ai-generate-learning-tips
}
